          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, the Supreme Court is considering a preliminary question of whether the arbitration clause in the parties\u2019 agreement permits class treatment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Seth P. Waxman, on behalf of the Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "96a930e090c5582bd850d08f21e22baf767083a592f7b2526ffeb317197a24ae",
            "evidence_ids": [
