            "pages": {
              "end": 14,
              "start": 14
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Seth P. Waxman, on behalf of the Petitioners, the parties argue that the construction of the arbitration clause, under AAA Rule\u202f3, determines whether class arbitration is allowed."
      }
    ],
